---
interface Props { data:any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="deed-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Vivienda</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Gastos de escritura</div><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Calculadora inmobiliaria 2026</span><h1>La propiedad vale<br>una cifra. Entrar,<br>un poco más.</h1><p>Calculá cuánto necesitás además del precio y entendé qué paga el comprador, qué paga el vendedor y quién cobra cada gasto.</p><div class="chips"><span>🏛️ CABA y PBA</span><span>🔑 Compra y venta</span><span>✓ Primera vivienda</span></div><div class="deed-art"><div class="paper"><div class="paper-head"><i>📄</i><b>Escritura traslativa de dominio</b></div><small>PRECIO DE OPERACIÓN</small><strong>$150.000.000</strong><div class="lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="keys">🔑</div><div class="seal">LISTO<br>PARA FIRMAR</div><span class="extra-tag">Reservá 8,1% extra</span></div></div>
    <form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá los gastos</h2><p>Empezamos por una compra en CABA.</p></div><span class="tag">Alícuotas 2026</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Cuál es tu situación?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="caba"><i>🏙️</i>Compro en CABA</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="pba"><i>🏡</i>Compro en PBA</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="first"><i>✨</i>Primera vivienda</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="sell"><i>🤝</i>Estoy vendiendo</button></div><div class="section-label">Datos de la operación</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label>Precio de compra o venta</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="deed-price" value="150.000.000"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Comisión inmobiliaria</label><div class="inline"><input id="deed-commission" type="number" min="0" value="4"><b>% + IVA</b></div></div><div class="field"><label>Tipo de propiedad</label><select id="deed-type"><option>Departamento</option><option>Casa</option><option>Terreno</option><option>Local</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Moneda de la operación</label><select id="deed-currency"><option value="ars">Pesos argentinos</option><option value="usd">Dólares estadounidenses</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>¿Hay crédito hipotecario?</label><select id="deed-mortgage"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Sí</option></select></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ Sellos repartidos 50/50</span><b>+ Valuación y excepciones</b></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Gastos estimados del comprador</small><div class="price" id="result-price">$12.180.000</div></div><div class="ratio"><small>Sobre el precio</small><strong id="result-ratio">8,1%</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Total para cerrar<b id="deed-closing">$162.180.000</b></span><span>Sellos incluidos<b id="deed-stamps">$2.025.000</b></span><span>Sin inmobiliaria<b id="deed-no-agency">$4.920.000</b></span></div><button class="go" type="button">Actualizar gastos</button></section></form>
  </div></section>
  <section class="split-section wrap"><header class="center"><span>Una operación, dos bolsillos</span><h2>Quién paga cada gasto</h2><p>Algunos conceptos se reparten; otros corresponden exclusivamente al comprador o al vendedor.</p></header><div class="split-grid"><article class="card buyer"><div class="card-head"><h3>🔑 Paga el comprador</h3><span class="badge">Tu lado</span></div><div class="cost"><span>Comisión inmobiliaria<small>4% + IVA</small></span><b>$7.260.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>Honorarios de escribanía<small>Escala + IVA y aportes</small></span><b>$2.445.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>50% del impuesto de sellos<small>CABA · operación bajo el umbral</small></span><b>$2.025.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>Registro y certificados<small>Dominio, inhibición e inscripción</small></span><b>$450.000</b></div><div class="card-total"><strong>Total comprador</strong><strong>$12.180.000</strong></div></article><article class="card seller"><div class="card-head"><h3>🏠 Paga el vendedor</h3><span class="badge">La otra parte</span></div><div class="cost"><span>Comisión inmobiliaria<small>Según acuerdo de comercialización</small></span><b>$7.260.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>50% del impuesto de sellos<small>Salvo pacto distinto</small></span><b>$2.025.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>Estudio de títulos y certificados<small>Documentación del inmueble</small></span><b>$195.000</b></div><div class="cost"><span>Impuesto cedular<small>Solo si corresponde por fecha y ganancia</small></span><b>$0</b></div><div class="card-total"><strong>Total vendedor</strong><strong>$9.480.000</strong></div></article></div></section>
  <section class="map"><div class="wrap map-grid"><div class="map-copy"><span>La ubicación cambia la cuenta</span><h2>CABA y Provincia no cobran lo mismo.</h2><p>La jurisdicción define la alícuota de sellos y las exenciones. Elegirla al principio evita una estimación engañosa.</p></div><div class="jurisdictions"><article class="jur active"><i>🏙️</i><h3>Ciudad de Buenos Aires</h3><p>Sellos 2,7% total para operaciones dentro del primer tramo, usualmente dividido entre las partes.</p><b>$12.180.000</b><small>Gastos del comprador</small><span class="pill">Caso seleccionado</span></article><article class="jur"><i>🏡</i><h3>Provincia de Buenos Aires</h3><p>Sellos 2% total según Ley Impositiva provincial, más tasas y honorarios locales.</p><b>$11.655.000</b><small>Gastos del comprador</small></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="concepts"><div class="wrap"><div class="concept-head"><div><span>Quién cobra qué</span><h2>Los cuatro rubros de una escritura</h2></div><div class="legend">Pedí cada concepto separado en el presupuesto</div></div><div class="concept-grid"><article class="concept"><i>✒️</i><h3>Escribanía</h3><p>Honorarios profesionales, IVA, aportes y estudio de títulos.</p><b>Se pacta y se presupuesta</b><span>La elige el comprador</span></article><article class="concept"><i>🏛️</i><h3>Impuesto de sellos</h3><p>Tributo local calculado sobre el mayor valor entre precio y valuación.</p><b>Se suele dividir 50/50</b><span>CABA o ARBA</span></article><article class="concept"><i>🏢</i><h3>Inmobiliaria</h3><p>Comisión por intermediación, negociación y cierre de la operación.</p><b>Porcentaje + IVA</b><span>Puede negociarse</span></article><article class="concept"><i>📚</i><h3>Registro</h3><p>Inscripción, certificados de dominio, inhibición y tasas administrativas.</p><b>Monto fijo o arancelado</b><span>RPI de cada jurisdicción</span></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="closing"><div class="wrap closing-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8fcba8">El día de la firma</span><h2>Llegá sabiendo cuánto llevar.</h2><p>Pedí un presupuesto final por escrito y confirmá moneda, forma de pago y distribución de sellos antes de sentarte a firmar.</p></div><div class="checklist"><div class="check"><i>✓</i><div><b>Saldo del precio</b><span>Transferencia o modalidad acordada</span></div><strong>$150.000.000</strong></div><div class="check"><i>✓</i><div><b>Gastos de escritura</b><span>Honorarios, sellos y registro</span></div><strong>$4.920.000</strong></div><div class="check"><i>✓</i><div><b>Comisión inmobiliaria</b><span>Separada para que puedas negociarla</span></div><strong>$7.260.000</strong></div><div class="check"><i>→</i><div><b>Total para cerrar</b><span>Precio más todos tus gastos</span></div><strong>$162.180.000</strong></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
</div>
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.querySelector(".deed-experience"),q=s=>root.querySelector(s),all=s=>root.querySelectorAll(s),money=n=>"$"+Math.round(Math.max(0,n)||0).toLocaleString("es-AR"),num=el=>Number(String(el.value).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",","."))||0;let mode="caba";
const calc=()=>{const price=Math.max(0,num(q("#deed-price"))),commission=price*num(q("#deed-commission"))/100*1.21,mortgage=q("#deed-mortgage").value==="yes"?price*.01:0,isSell=mode==="sell",stampRate=mode==="pba"?.02:.027,exempt=mode==="first"?Math.min(price,80000000):0,stamps=Math.max(0,price-exempt)*stampRate/2,notary=isSell?195000:price*.0135+420000,fixed=isSell?195000:450000,cost=commission+stamps+notary+fixed+mortgage,total=isSell?cost:price+cost;q("#result-label").textContent=isSell?"Gastos estimados del vendedor":mode==="first"?"Gastos con exención estimada":"Gastos estimados del comprador";q("#result-price").textContent=money(cost);q("#result-ratio").textContent=(price?cost/price*100:0).toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:1})+"%";q("#deed-closing").textContent=money(total);q("#deed-stamps").textContent=money(stamps);q("#deed-no-agency").textContent=money(cost-commission)};
all(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{all(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");mode=b.dataset.case;calc()}));all(".calc input,.calc select").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("input",calc));q(".go").addEventListener("click",e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Gastos actualizados";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar gastos",1200)});calc()})();
</script>
<style>
.deed-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#111f39;background:#fff;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#11213a;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button:focus{outline:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e6eb;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#19324c;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#19324c;color:#fff;border-color:#19324c}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f7faf9 0%,#f7faf9 58%,#eef7f0 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#247549}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#247549;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#247549}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#102038}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187;max-width:500px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce6e0;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#53677e;font-size:10px}
    .deed-art{height:240px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.paper{position:absolute;left:55px;top:18px;width:238px;height:184px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e3dc;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385816;padding:21px 23px;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.paper-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e9e5;padding-bottom:11px}.paper-head i{font-style:normal;font-size:20px}.paper-head b{font-size:11px}.paper small{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#76879a;margin-top:13px}.paper strong{font-size:25px;display:block;margin-top:3px}.lines{margin-top:12px}.lines i{display:block;height:5px;background:#e8edeb;border-radius:99px;margin:6px 0}.lines i:nth-child(2){width:78%}.seal{position:absolute;right:45px;bottom:10px;width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:50%;background:#287a4d;color:#fff;border:8px solid #e2f1e7;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:850;transform:rotate(8deg)}.keys{position:absolute;right:20px;top:2px;font-size:59px;transform:rotate(-14deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 10px #54421f22)}.extra-tag{position:absolute;left:3px;bottom:15px;background:#fff4da;color:#7d5a1d;border:1px solid #ecd8aa;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
    .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4dd;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#6b7d91;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#247549;background:#e7f4eb;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5df;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#5d7188;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:65px;cursor:pointer}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #287a4d;background:#eff8f2;color:#206b42}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4df;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#77879a;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#65788d;font-size:9px}.advanced b{color:#247549}.result{background:#19324c;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#b9cbdd}.price{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.ratio{background:#fff2ce;color:#76551d;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.ratio strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #3b5570;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#afc0d1}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#2b7d4f;color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px;cursor:pointer}
    .split-section{padding:74px 0 67px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#247549;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#687a8f;line-height:1.6}.split-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{border:1px solid #dce5e0;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b}.card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:19px}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0}.badge{font-size:8px;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#247549;font-weight:800}.seller .badge{background:#fff2d8;color:#795a21}.cost{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e9e6;padding:12px 0}.cost span{font-size:10px}.cost b{font-size:12px}.cost small{display:block;color:#7b8b9c;font-size:8px;margin-top:3px}.card-total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:18px}.card-total strong:last-child{font-size:20px;color:#247549}.seller .card-total strong:last-child{color:#b1762d}
    .map{background:#f2f7f4;padding:68px 0}.map-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.78fr 1.22fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}.map-copy span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#247549;font-weight:850}.map-copy h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 14px}.map-copy p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.jurisdictions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.jur{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5e0;border-radius:15px;padding:21px}.jur.active{border:2px solid #2b7d4f}.jur i{font-style:normal;font-size:24px}.jur h3{font-size:14px;margin:11px 0 5px}.jur p{font-size:9px;color:#74879a;line-height:1.5}.jur b{font-size:17px;color:#247549;display:block;margin-top:14px}.jur small{font-size:8px;color:#7b8c9b}.jur .pill{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#247549;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px;font-size:8px;font-weight:800}
    .concepts{padding:69px 0}.concept-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:27px}.concept-head h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 0}.concept-head>div>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#247549;font-weight:850}.legend{font-size:9px;color:#64778d}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.concept{border:1px solid #dce5e0;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;min-height:180px}.concept i{font-style:normal;font-size:23px}.concept h3{font-size:13px;margin:11px 0 6px}.concept p{font-size:9px;color:#77899c;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.concept b{display:block;color:#247549;font-size:13px;margin-top:17px}.concept span{font-size:8px;color:#7b8c9d}
    .closing{background:#19324c;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.closing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.closing h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0 13px}.closing p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#bdccda}.checklist{background:#fff;color:#19324c;border-radius:16px;padding:21px}.check{display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:12px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e9e5}.check:last-child{border:0}.check i{font-style:normal;width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:9px;background:#e8f4ec;display:grid;place-items:center}.check b{font-size:10px}.check span{font-size:8px;color:#728497}.check strong{font-size:11px}.foot{height:110px}
    @media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.split-grid,.map-grid,.closing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.deed-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.concept-head{display:block}.legend{margin-top:10px}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.paper{left:24px}.keys{right:4px}.seal{right:9px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.jurisdictions,.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#397dd0;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#78899c;margin-top:4px}
@media(max-width:800px){.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
